; The 16-bit Windows .res format: no empty first resource; each resource
; has its type and name (0xFF and a WORD for an ordinal), WORD memory flags
; and a DWORD size, unaligned; strings are 8-bit.
; RUN: llvm-rc -no-preprocess -win16 /FO %t.res -- %p/Inputs/win16.rc
; RUN: %python -c "import sys; print(open(sys.argv[1], 'rb').read().hex(' '))" %t.res | FileCheck %s

; MENU: a popup with an item, a separator and a last item (0x80).
; CHECK: ff 04 00 ff 01 00 30 10 25 00 00 00
; CHECK-SAME: 00 00 00 00 90 00 26 46 69 6c 65 00 00 00 65 00 26 4f 70 65 6e 00 00 00 00 00 00 80 00 66 00 45 26 78 69 74 00
; ACCELERATORS: a BYTE of flags, the key and the ID.
; CHECK-SAME: ff 09 00 ff 02 00 30 00 0a 00 00 00
; CHECK-SAME: 00 0f 00 65 00 91 73 00 66 00
; DIALOG: style, a BYTE count, the frame, menu, class, caption and font;
; controls with their class as a byte.
; CHECK-SAME: ff 05 00 ff 03 00 30 10 3c 00 00 00
; CHECK-SAME: c0 00 c8 80 02 01 00 02 00 1e 00 28 00 00 00 41 62 00 08 00 53 79 73 00
; CHECK-SAME: 01 00 02 00 03 00 04 00 ff ff 00 00 02 50 82 4e 00 00
; CHECK-SAME: 05 00 06 00 07 00 08 00 07 00 00 00 01 50 80 42 00 00
; RCDATA.
; CHECK-SAME: ff 0a 00 ff 04 00 30 00 04 00 00 00 34 12 61 62
; VERSIONINFO: no type fields, 8-bit keys and values, aligned from the start
; of the resource data.
; CHECK-SAME: ff 10 00 ff 01 00 30 00 77 00 00 00
; CHECK-SAME: 77 00 34 00 56 53 5f 56 45 52 53 49 4f 4e 5f 49 4e 46 4f 00 bd 04 ef fe 00 00 01 00 02 00 01 00 04 00 03 00
; CHECK-SAME: 2f 00 00 00 53 74 72 69 6e 67 46 69 6c 65 49 6e 66 6f 00 00
; CHECK-SAME: 1b 00 00 00 30 34 30 39 30 34 45 34 00 00 00 00 0b 00 03 00 41 00 00 00 78 79 00
; STRINGTABLE, at the end: a BYTE length per string.
; CHECK-SAME: ff 06 00 ff 01 00 30 10 12 00 00 00 00 02 48 69 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00{{$}}

; RUN: not llvm-rc -no-preprocess -win16 /FO %t.res -- %p/Inputs/menuex.rc 2>&1 | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=MENUEX
; MENUEX: MENUEX is not in 16-bit Windows
